WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Generic demo: tap, save a note and switch tabs.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.000
Completing the three actions unlocks Hardcore, without a mascot.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Mucho: pointer movement draws real fluid over the page.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.880
Hardcore: larger radius; controls and native pointer remain visible.
